  "details": "the world is looking at a horrific event, The Russia Ukraine War. We don't know whats going to come next (maybe world war 3) but We are witnessing protests from all over the world. So i wanted to gather as much as our Vrchat users and protest virtually so as to show solidarity with Ukraine 🇺🇦 and say no to War. \nThe protest even if lasts for 5 minutes will show the world that people from different nationalities, ethnicities, religion and backgrounds can come together and stand up against violence, war and Opression. And it is only possible in the Virtual world or Metaverse\nThis protest Or gathering can be done in a World where there is a lot of space, like for example the MC Donalds world : Open roads and fields. (Its Just an example, it can be anywhere which is suitable for a large crowd) \nSo, For this I will need your help as I am in vrchat from past 3 months only. My contacts are limited. If you could help direct people into a particular world in the same day at the same time ⌚ then it is surely possible. And this can be done by posting hoardings in the most popular worlds like... Black Cat, Movie & Chill etc. \nThis might be a Historic event as it will be the First Metaverse Or VR Protest. \nI hope you can help me in this Righteous Deed. I am ready to go to any lengths to make this possible. \nMy ID is aciph\nYours Truly, \nAciph\nA Vrchat Citizen",
